{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56031","headline":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 通宾主 · 缘密","name":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 通宾主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自远趋风问，分明向道休。\n再三如不（《天圣广灯录》作「未」）晓，消得个非遥。\n（《天圣广灯录》作「更摇头」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缘密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}